sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Owner
  box rgb(255,250,246) Control plane
    participant L as Legible agent
    participant E as Errand workers
  end
  box rgb(251,250,247) External services
    participant C as Exa + BFS crawl
    participant M as Muse Spark
  end
  box rgb(245,249,255) Edge tier
    participant W as Worker
  end

  Owner->>L: POST /websites
  L->>C: Crawl the site
  C-->>L: Pages and images
  L->>M: Transcribe images (vision)
  L->>M: Extract typed fact sheet
  Note over L,E: Save version 1, every item a draft
  L->>M: Find blockers (at most 5 questions)
  L->>M: Write customer requests
  L->>E: Run agents on the website
  E-->>L: Answer, outcome, claims with evidence
  L->>M: Map failed runs to missing facts
  L-->>Owner: Questions, linked to the runs they block
  Owner->>L: Answer in plain language, confirm facts
  L->>M: Turn answers into typed operations
  L->>W: PUT /admin/businesses/{slug}, confirmed only
  Owner->>L: Run the check again
  L->>W: Publish a private preview
  L->>E: Same requests, pointed at the preview
  E-->>L: New results
  L-->>Owner: Compare the two scores
